# The Franking Works (CIPlay franking_works_solo; in the plan after Telegraph Narrows): quest "Rare Stamps"
# (it needs Ada's dead letter from The Dead Letter Office: franking_works_solo.play reads it first)
island The Franking Works
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Rare Stamps
expect hidden adamap
zone yard
expect step 1
read Franking master's ledger
expect step 2
use stampalbum
expect message three empty frames
open Vault
expect message bolted
use stamp1
use stamp2
use stamp3
expect story raft-Tangaroa_Token 3
expect step 3
use stampalbum
expect story albumfull 1
expect step 4
open Vault
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_SmelterElectric 1
expect item Blueprint_BiofuelExtractorAdvanced 1
expect item Blueprint_AnchorStationaryAdvanced 1
expect step 8
use adahole
expect story adadelivered 1
expect shown adamap
expect step 9
read Ada's route map
expect done
